<div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-4">Create Policy</h2>
<form method="post" action="/orgs/testorg/projects/my-api/settings/policies" class="space-y-4" id="policy-form">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="test-csrf">
<div>
<label for="policy-name" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Name</label>
<input type="text" id="policy-name" name="name" required placeholder="e.g. staging-soak-30m" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gray-900">
</div>
<div>
<label for="policy-type" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Type</label>
<select id="policy-type" name="policy_type" class="border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gray-900">
<option value="soak_time" data-description="Require an artifact to succeed in a source environment for a duration before deploying to target.">Soak Time</option><option value="branch_restriction" data-description="Only allow deployments to the target environment from a specific branch pattern.">Branch Restriction</option><option value="approval" data-description="Require one or more team members to approve before deploying to the target environment.">Approval Required</option><option value="supersede_pending" data-description="When releases queue up for a destination, deploy the newest and mark the ones it overtook superseded instead of deploying each in turn.">Supersede Pending</option>
</select>
<p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1" id="policy-type-desc">Require an artifact to succeed in a source environment for a duration before deploying to target.</p>
</div>
<div id="soak-time-fields"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
<div>
<label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Source environment</label>
<select name="source_environment" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm bg-white">

<option value="dev">dev</option><option value="staging">staging</option><option value="prod">prod</option>
</select>
</div>
<div>
<label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Target environment</label>
<select name="target_environment" id="soak-target-env" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm bg-white">

<option value="dev">dev</option><option value="staging">staging</option><option value="prod">prod</option>
</select>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-3">
<label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Soak duration (seconds)</label>
<input type="number" name="duration_seconds" min="1" placeholder="1800" class="w-48 border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gray-900">
<p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">e.g. 1800 = 30 minutes, 3600 = 1 hour</p>
</div></div>
<div id="branch-restriction-fields" class="hidden"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
<div>
<label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Branch pattern</label>
<input type="text" name="branch_pattern" placeholder="e.g. main" disabled class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-mono focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gray-900">
</div>
<div>
<label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Target environment</label>
<select name="target_environment" id="branch-target-env" disabled class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm bg-white">

<option value="dev">dev</option><option value="staging">staging</option><option value="prod">prod</option>
</select>
</div>
</div></div>
<div id="approval-fields" class="hidden"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
<div>
<label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Target environment</label>
<select name="target_environment" id="approval-target-env" disabled class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm bg-white">

<option value="dev">dev</option><option value="staging">staging</option><option value="prod">prod</option>
</select>
</div>
<div>
<label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Required approvals</label>
<input type="number" name="required_approvals" min="1" value="1" placeholder="1" disabled class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gray-900">
<p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Number of distinct approvals needed before deployment proceeds.</p>
</div>
</div></div>
<div id="supersede-pending-fields" class="hidden"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
<div>
<label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Target environment</label>
<select name="target_environment" id="supersede-pending-target-env" disabled class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm bg-white">

<option value="dev">dev</option><option value="staging">staging</option><option value="prod">prod</option>
</select>
</div>
<div>
<label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">
<input type="checkbox" name="same_branch_only" value="1" disabled class="rounded border-gray-300 text-gray-900 focus:ring-gray-900"> Same branch only</label>
<p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Only supersede a pending release when the newer one is on the same branch, so a hotfix off another branch still deploys.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-3">A deploy already running is never interrupted — it finishes, and the queue behind it collapses to the newest.</p></div>
<button type="submit" class="bg-gray-900 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-sm hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors">Create Policy</button>
</form></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</main>
